      "pText": "The Curve Post Swing is a two-seat swing set with curved teal posts and bright yellow seats, made for children aged 6 to 12. Two children can swing at the same time, and the curved frame gives it a softer look than a straight A-frame in a school or society garden. It needs a safe play area of about 11'1\" x 13'3\". It comes in Horizon Teal and carries a 3-year warranty on the galvanised pipes and a 1-year warranty on bearings and spare parts. Send us your site size and we will show you where it fits on a layout drawing."
